<main class="pc" data-product-core="configuration"><p class="pc-kicker">CRANIO SYSTEMS / 02 / Configuration</p><h1>머리 방향</h1><p class="pc-lead">각도는 예시이며 개인 측정값이 아닙니다.</p><div class="pc-steps" role="navigation" aria-label="CRANIO"><a href="../your-cranium/">01 · Personal Navigator</a><a href="../configuration/" aria-current="page">02 · Configuration</a><a href="../potential/">03 · Potential</a></div><section class="pc-section"><div class="pc-three"><div class="pc-card"><p class="pc-kicker">정면</p><h3>측면 기울기</h3><svg viewBox="0 0 240 250" role="img" aria-label="C0–C1"><g fill="none" stroke="currentColor" opacity=".25"><circle cx="120" cy="125" r="97"/><path d="M120 15V235M15 125H225" stroke-dasharray="4 6"/></g><path d="M72 230Q90 197 106 185L111 125H129L134 185Q150 197 168 230" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" opacity=".5" stroke-width="2"/><g class="pc-rotate" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="M120 25Q65 25 65 75Q65 105 108 119L120 130L132 119Q175 105 175 75Q175 25 120 25Z"/><path d="M77 77H163M120 30V121" stroke-dasharray="4 5"/></g><circle cx="120" cy="125" r="6" fill="var(--pa)"/><circle cx="120" cy="125" r="13" stroke="var(--pa)" fill="none"/></svg><label for="pc-angle-0">측면 기울기 <output for="pc-angle-0">0°</output></label><input data-angle id="pc-angle-0" type="range" min="-15" max="15" step="1" value="0" data-js hidden></div><div class="pc-card"><p class="pc-kicker">위에서 본 모습</p><h3>회전</h3><svg viewBox="0 0 240 250" role="img" aria-label="C0–C1"><g fill="none" stroke="currentColor" opacity=".25"><circle cx="120" cy="125" r="97"/><path d="M120 15V235M15 125H225" stroke-dasharray="4 6"/></g><circle cx="120" cy="125" r="36" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"/><g class="pc-rotate" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><ellipse cx="120" cy="125" rx="64" ry="82"/><path d="M109 48L120 31L131 48M120 45V205" stroke-dasharray="4 5"/></g><circle cx="120" cy="125" r="6" fill="var(--pa)"/><circle cx="120" cy="125" r="13" stroke="var(--pa)" fill="none"/></svg><label for="pc-angle-1">회전 <output for="pc-angle-1">0°</output></label><input data-angle id="pc-angle-1" type="range" min="-15" max="15" step="1" value="0" data-js hidden></div><div class="pc-card"><p class="pc-kicker">측면</p><h3>앞뒤 기울기</h3><svg viewBox="0 0 240 250" role="img" aria-label="C0–C1"><g fill="none" stroke="currentColor" opacity=".25"><circle cx="120" cy="125" r="97"/><path d="M120 15V235M15 125H225" stroke-dasharray="4 6"/></g><path d="M72 230Q90 197 106 185L111 125H129L134 185Q150 197 168 230" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" opacity=".5" stroke-width="2"/><g class="pc-rotate" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="M120 30Q64 30 70 86L87 110L111 120L120 130L143 111L162 102L153 88L166 78L152 57Q142 30 120 30Z"/><path d="M120 35V124M77 83H158" stroke-dasharray="4 5"/></g><circle cx="120" cy="125" r="6" fill="var(--pa)"/><circle cx="120" cy="125" r="13" stroke="var(--pa)" fill="none"/></svg><label for="pc-angle-2">앞뒤 기울기 <output for="pc-angle-2">0°</output></label><input data-angle id="pc-angle-2" type="range" min="-15" max="15" step="1" value="0" data-js hidden></div></div><div class="pc-actions"><button type="button" data-reset data-js hidden>초기화</button></div><p class="pc-note">각도는 예시이며 개인 측정값이 아닙니다.</p><a class="pc-link" href="../c0-c1/">C0–C1 ↗</a></section><section class="pc-section"><div class="pc-actions"><a class="pc-button primary" href="../potential/">계속 · Potential ↗</a><a class="pc-button" href="../start/">상황 상담</a></div><details class="pc-legacy"><summary>기존 자료</summary><section class="hero"><p class="eyebrow">CRANIO / 구성</p><h2>구성</h2><p class="lead">인간은 서로 상호작용하는 여러 시스템으로 이루어진 시스템입니다. CRANIO은 머리와 목의 경험에서 출발해 그 구성을 이해하도록 돕습니다.</p></section><section class="band"><h2>구성이란 한 부위만 바꾸는 것이 아니라 시스템 전체가 어떻게 조직되고 시간이 지나며 어떻게 변하는지 이해하는 것입니다.</h2><p>OBSERVE → CALIBRATE → IDENTIFY → OPTIMIZE → VERIFY</p></section></details></section></main>